<title>HONG KONG: Sun Hung Kai &amp; Co H1 net down 22.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Sun Hung Kai &amp; Co H1 net down 22.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   6.5	  vs 8.4 (see note)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.0	  vs 3.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  19.50 loss vs 10.27 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    44.93	vs 58.12 (see note)</p>
<p>    Turnover		     324.24     vs 309.93 (see note)</p>
<p>    Company name		 Sun Hung Kai &amp; Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 1-10</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 24</p>
<p>NOTE - A financial services and brokerage firm.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on deemed disposal of a listed associated company following dilution in shareholding as a result of share issue not taken up.</p>
<p>Comparative turnover restated to conform with current period presentation after adoption of Statement of Standard Accounting Practice 18.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
